#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:2
msgid "Sessions and Conversation History"
msgstr "会话和对话历史"

#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:4
msgid ""
"A session is a durable working thread for one project context. It "
"contains the conversation timeline, attachments, agent runs, plans, "
"approvals, tool results, and relevant layout state."
msgstr "会话是围绕一个项目上下文持续存在的工作线程。它包含对话时间线、附件、agent 运行、计划、审批、工具结果以及相关的布局状态。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:9
msgid "Use sessions intentionally"
msgstr "有意识地使用会话"

#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:11
msgid ""
"Create a new session when the task has a different goal, risk level, or "
"context. Continue the existing session when the new request depends on "
"the same investigation and evidence."
msgstr "当任务的目标、风险级别或上下文不同时，创建新会话。当新请求依赖同一项调查和证据时，继续使用现有会话。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:15
msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "示例："

#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:17
msgid "Keep a scene refactor and its follow-up validation in one session."
msgstr "将场景重构及其后续验证放在同一个会话中。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:18
msgid ""
"Start a separate session for a new feature so its context does not "
"compete with the refactor."
msgstr "为新功能启动单独的会话，避免它的上下文与重构任务相互干扰。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:20
msgid ""
"Use a read-only session to investigate a bug before opening a session "
"that is allowed to edit files."
msgstr "先使用只读会话调查问题，再打开允许编辑文件的会话。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:24
msgid "Session actions"
msgstr "会话操作"

#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:26
msgid "Studio supports the following session lifecycle actions:"
msgstr "Studio 支持以下会话生命周期操作："

#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:28
msgid "Create a new session from the workspace."
msgstr "从工作区创建新会话。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:29
msgid "Move between previous and next sessions."
msgstr "在上一个和下一个会话之间切换。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:30
msgid "Continue an interrupted or approval-paused run when it is safe to do so."
msgstr "在安全的情况下，继续被中断或因等待审批而暂停的运行。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:31
msgid ""
"Fork a session when you want to explore a different approach without "
"changing the original conversation."
msgstr "想要探索不同方法但不改变原始对话时，复制一个会话分支。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:33
msgid ""
"Archive a completed or inactive session. Archived sessions remain "
"searchable from **Settings > Archived sessions**."
msgstr "归档已完成或不活跃的会话。归档后的会话仍可从 **Settings > Archived sessions** 搜索。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:35
msgid ""
"Export session content when you need a portable record, after checking it"
" for private prompts, file paths, and credentials."
msgstr "需要可携带的记录时，可以导出会话内容；导出前请检查其中是否包含私密提示词、文件路径和凭据。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:39
msgid "Layouts and terminal tabs"
msgstr "布局和终端标签页"

#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:41
msgid ""
"Panel positions, tabs, and dimensions are saved per session where "
"applicable. Terminal processes are isolated by session and are not "
"restored as running processes after Studio restarts. Start a new terminal"
" task after a restart and re-check its working directory."
msgstr "在适用的情况下，面板位置、标签页和尺寸会按会话保存。终端进程按会话隔离，Studio 重启后不会作为正在运行的进程恢复。重启后请启动新的终端任务，并重新检查其工作目录。"

#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:47
msgid "Search and navigation"
msgstr "搜索和导航"

#: ../../source/workspaces/sessions.rst:49
msgid ""
"Use conversation search to find a message, tool result, or verification "
"detail inside the current history. Use the archived-session search when "
"you need a session that is no longer in the active workspace tree."
msgstr "使用对话搜索在当前历史记录中查找消息、工具结果或验证细节。当需要查找已不在活动工作区树中的会话时，使用归档会话搜索。"
